जृम्भ् जृम्भते (जृम्भ˚ति), pp. जृम्भित (q.v.)
gape, yawn, open (of a flower), blossom;
 spread, extend;
 come forth,
rise;
 be or feel at ease. C. जृम्भयति cause to yawn. 1.
जरी-जृम्भते extend far. — उद् & समुद् open wide, come forth,
appear, arise. परि spread round. प्र begin to yawn. वि yawn,
gape, blossom, expand, break forth, appear;
 be or feel at ease. सम्
expand, break forth, appear. — Cf. विजृम्भित.
